{
  "title": "Q-MATH-16.25 static-Ward-subtracted dynamic kernel",
  "scope": "Insulating M0 parameter sets only. The SOC=0 control is gapless and excluded from this static-subtracted formula. No nonlinear HHG or quantized BSV prediction.",
